From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:10:04 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: qcom,sm8250: Add Lenovo Legion Y700 (2025)
 sound card

Add the sound card of the Lenovo Legion Y700 (2025), TB321FU, an
SM8650 tablet with two speaker amplifiers on secondary TDM.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
index e2e3fc99e..0c89f7c21 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ properties:
           - ayaneo,pocket-s2-sndcard
           - fairphone,fp4-sndcard
           - fairphone,fp5-sndcard
+          - lenovo,tb321fu-sndcard
           - motorola,dubai-sndcard
           - qcom,apq8096-sndcard
           - qcom,glymur-sndcard
-- 
